CharacterName,Juggernaut,Juggernaut
CharacterName,Morphling,Morphling
CharacterName,Pudge,
ClassDescription,"A DOTA2 butcher who drags foes to his cleaver with Meat Hook, chokes everything nearby with Rot, shrugs off blows behind a Meat Shield, devours his prey with Dismember, and grows ever stronger with every hero-tier kill through Flesh Heap.",
ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.","Isang maliksing bayani ng DOTA2 na nag-uutos ng malalakas na alon, malayang naglilipat sa pagitan ng Lakas at Liksi, nagpapalakas sa pamamagitan ng Taas at Baba ng Alon, at nagpapalit-anyo bilang mga kalaban."
ClassDescription,"A masked DOTA2 blademaster who builds unstoppable momentum through Bladeform, carves through magic with Blade Fury, sustains allies with Healing Ward, and cuts down foes with Blade Dance and Omnislash.","Isang nakamaskarang dalubhasa sa talim mula sa DOTA2 na nag-iipon ng walang pigil na puwersa sa Anyo ng Talim, humihiwa ng mahika gamit ang Poot ng Talim, nagpapagaling ng kakampi sa Totem ng Paghilom, at pumapatay ng mga kaaway gamit ang Sayaw ng Talim at Omnislash."
ClassDescription,"A relentless DOTA2 crimson berserker who thrives alone with One Man Army, taunts entire rooms with Berserker's Call, carves attackers with Pure Counter Helix spins, and executes the weak with Culling Blade.","Isang walang-awang pulang berserker ng DOTA2 na lumalakas kapag mag-isa gamit ang Hukbo ng Isang Tao, nang-aasar ng buong silid gamit ang Tawag ng Berserker, hinihiwa ang mga umaatake gamit ang Pure na ikot ng Counter Helix, at binibitay ang mahihina gamit ang Culling Blade."
